      "message": "This parameter would be better as an enum.\n\nenum shell_priority {\n     NORMAL_PRIORITY,\n     HIGH_PRIORITY\n}\n\nThen the console command macros become:\n\n#define DECLARE_CONSOLE_COMMAND(...) \\\n  _ZEPHYR_SHELL_COMMAND_SHIM(..., NORMAL_PRIORITY)\n#define DECLARE_HIGH_PRIORITY_CONSOLE_COMMAND(...) \\\n  _ZEPHYR_SHELL_COMMAND_SHIM(..., HIGH_PRIORITY)",
